# Generated media stays out of Git — this repository tracks no binary over 1 MB,
# and captured screens are not source artifacts (see the root .gitignore).
# The plates below come from a fresh capture; voice/BGM from the offline engines;
# the rest from a render. The mark geometry is text (observe-*.json), so it stays.
renders/
snapshots/
jarvis-promo/assets/bgm/
jarvis-promo/assets/voice/
jarvis-promo/assets/*.png
jarvis-promo/capture/assets/*.png
jarvis-promo/.hyperframes/
node_modules/
